      "value": "This doesn't appear to be a bug report, and is instead what we'd consider a support request.\nPlease contact our [Support team](http://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/new) and report your issue there. Please include as much information as possible, such as game logs, screenshots, and etc. Video is also very helpful, if applicable.\nIn the mean-time, you can try checking out http://help.vrchat.com and see if any of the solutions listed there help you out.\nOur support team will get back to you as soon as possible.",
