  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Almost every time I start Vrchat I am logged out. I suspect this is because my IP changes every night.\nGetting logged out is annoying because I need to type the login information again, especially so in VR.\nForcing a log out when the ip changes could be reasonable if the country associated with ip changes but the current check is not smart enough.",
